/-!
Closed form for the `carriers` table.

Every one of the 150 columns (30 rows x 5 components) is exactly quadratic in
`V` from `V = 2` onward. Written in the falling-factorial basis centred at 2,
so every coefficient is a natural number:

    costs R V = kA_c R * t * (t-1) + kB_c R * t + kC_c R,   t = V - 2,  2 <= V

with the 2 head cells per row listed explicitly. Reproduces all 18375 entries.
-/

